in ritual. At the end of the 30 mins tour, the guide demanded for another 1000rupee from each of us. We didn't agree as it was not stated before hand. Out of courtesy, we tried to tip him 800 rupee, in which he did not accept and started to berate and curse us. Fortunately we left safely. ", "review_tip": null, "rating": 1, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2019-04-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "FDFEF1B2F331D3B47ED819FEC914CDBD", "name": "Jhchee", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Jhchee", "username": "Jhchee", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/e5/2b/default-avatar-2020-52.jpg", "contribution_count": 16, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-04-14", "published_at_date": "2019-04-14"}, {"review_id": 666222404, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r666222404-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Must See in Kathmandu", "text": "An ancient temple with many stories associated with it. A must see for anyone visiting Kathmandu. Recommend visiting around 6 00 pm in the evening to catch the Aarti.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "business", "stay_date": "2018-06-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "A1B212319A65578FE73EA6DC0BA66DB6", "name": "sundara", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/sundara", "username": "sundara", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-s/02/60/8a/55/sundara.jpg", "contribution_count": 105, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-04-14", "published_at_date": "2019-04-14"}, {"review_id": 6661